    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_BattleNet_OAuthHelp">Reading WoW achievements uses Blizzard's official API, which needs a free API client tied to your Battle.net account. You only have to set this up once:</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_BattleNet_SetupStep1">1. Open the {0} and create a new client (any name and details are fine).</sys:String>
